{"completed": true, "response": "总体排名：**图A > 图B > 图C。**\n\n- **图A**最适合继续制作视频版。短条目便于扫读，人物每一步为什么发生变化，大多能看清。主要问题是回溯箭头偏多、末段重复，以及几处重要的理解变化没有标出。\n- **图B**的心理因果最自然，保留了不少原稿的细微变化，但正文过于密集，关系注释又反复解释正文已经说过的内容。读起来顺，作为 Thread 图却不够一眼明白。\n- **图C**的局部推进最显眼，但把许多并列描述、补充说明也用“→”串成了因果链。条目过碎，148–180、226–241 和 254–288 尤其需要合并。\n\n三张图使用的 Center 都基本成立：它抓住了行动与温柔愿望之间的牵扯，没有把开头写成结局，也没有要求每段都在推进同一结论。主要差别在于因果连接是否有原稿依据、心理变化有没有被过度拆碎，以及表达能否适应视频观看。\n\n**条目数口径：**按正文中可独立呈现的叙事条目估算；图A、图C按叙事 bullet 计，图B按正文段落块计，`←` 和 `⟲` 注释不另计。因此图B的条目数较少，不代表它的文字更精简。\n\n```json\n{\n  \"ranking\": [\n    \"图A\",\n    \"图B\",\n    \"图C\"\n  ],\n  \"graphs\": {\n    \"图A\": {\n      \"why_now\": 8,\n      \"center\": 8,\n      \"history_connection\": 7,\n      \"insight\": 7,\n      \"accumulation\": 7,\n      \"faithful\": 8,\n      \"standalone\": 8,\n      \"efficiency\": 6,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 7,\n      \"words\": 6,\n      \"glance\": 8,\n      \"items_now\": 74,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 56,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–65\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 动摇：（1–23）「因反复摇摆而难堪」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"148–180\",\n          \"quote\": \"他慢慢发现，自己舍不得的是曾经真心相信能有的生活\",\n          \"type\": \"标签贴错\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"181–205\",\n          \"quote\": \"「沉浸真实安宁不愿离开」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"214–215\",\n          \"quote\": \"⟲「因反复摇摆而难堪」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"226–241\",\n          \"quote\": \"「带着舍不得、没把握和可能的痛苦去承担」／「不再愿意让惧怕替他决定」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"两股心意此刻竟能够共同支持他\",\n          \"type\": \"标签贴错\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"「带着不舍向前」／「他可以带着这样的不舍，继续向前」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"⟲「盼望亲近不必争夺」；「怕争取耗尽心中温柔」；「争取安宁反失安宁」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 7,\n      \"verdict\": \"三者中最适合继续制作：条目短、心理变化清楚，但需收紧回溯箭头、合并相近的行动表述，并补出关键的理解积累标签。\"\n    },\n    \"图B\": {\n      \"why_now\": 8,\n      \"center\": 8,\n      \"history_connection\": 7,\n      \"insight\": 8,\n      \"accumulation\": 7,\n      \"faithful\": 7,\n      \"standalone\": 9,\n      \"efficiency\": 5,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 8,\n      \"words\": 6,\n      \"glance\": 5,\n      \"items_now\": 18,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 16,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–65\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 提供理由：（1–23）「反复犹豫」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"66–91\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 唤起：（24–65）「倾尽全力的畅快」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"116–147\",\n          \"quote\": \"把已经疲惫的自己催逼得近乎苛刻\",\n          \"type\": \"编造\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"148–180\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 说明：（24–65）「没有跟着昂扬起来的地方」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"181–205\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 限制：「这份安宁」；← 提供理由：「那种生活」；← 唤起：「深深的满足」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"226–241\",\n          \"quote\": \"本段末尾整组八条「←」回链\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"1–23\",\n          \"quote\": \"刚觉得站稳\",\n          \"type\": \"抽象词\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"✦ 分清\",\n          \"type\": \"标签贴错\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 6,\n      \"verdict\": \"心理因果和人物内心的具体感较强，但长段把多个变化塞在一起，来源箭头也有过度注释的问题；需要拆分关键转折并大幅压缩回链。\"\n    },\n    \"图C\": {\n      \"why_now\": 7,\n      \"center\": 8,\n      \"history_connection\": 6,\n      \"insight\": 7,\n      \"accumulation\": 6,\n      \"faithful\": 8,\n      \"standalone\": 8,\n      \"efficiency\": 4,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 7,\n      \"words\": 6,\n      \"glance\": 4,\n      \"items_now\": 102,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 73,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–65\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（1–23）「难堪于反复摇摆」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"66–91\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 提供理由：（24–65）「投入付出本身带来快乐」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"148–180\",\n          \"quote\": \"「依恋指向一种曾真心相信的生活」\",\n          \"type\": \"标签贴错\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"148–180\",\n          \"quote\": \"「他暂不追问这种生活能否实现」／「仅仅允许自己这样去爱、去相信」／「这份安宁并非虚假」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"206–213\",\n          \"quote\": \"「不想每次想起都立刻拿它审问自己」／「暂时不想那些尚无答案的事」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"214–215\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 唤起：（206–213）「欢喜中已经带着不舍」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"216–225\",\n          \"quote\": \"「无法再只凭最初那股决心向前」／「两种办法都曾帮过他，也各自留下难处」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"226–241\",\n          \"quote\": \"「要让两样东西都毫发无伤地留下」／「为它争取也可能让自己失去安宁」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"226–241\",\n          \"quote\": \"「不再要求自己先毫不害怕」／「临近真正承担时，他仍清楚自己会怕」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"242–253\",\n          \"quote\": \"「知道自己要承担什么，也知道为何难以割舍」／「愿为真心爱惜的一切负责」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"「两股曾拉扯他的心意开始共同支持他」\",\n          \"type\": \"标签贴错\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"「他仍向往安宁，也仍愿意行动」／「不愿靠遗忘任何一边求得安稳」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 5,\n      \"verdict\": \"心理过程虽然被拆得很细，但大量并列内容被箭头写成了连续因果，多个段落又把同一认识拆成数条近义表达，当前版本不适合直接上屏。\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3e403b91-5e88-4ec5-b7be-12544c11587a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261022T012314685030Z", "elapsed_seconds": 302.469, "completed_utc": "2026-10-22T01:28:17.168779+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f6de14478bd1d9f2d4650c7a49c3dc91002ce12504a916ebec79934ccbbb4df5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261022T012314685030Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ba7310f2f8cd8251819f92f183b3c699e2ac3ae9fcd8e8634d39e0f53dabc4cb"}}}
